Build the API with Go 1.25 using the standard library HTTP server (`net/http`) and the frontend with React (TypeScript, built with Vite). The backend serves the API and the frontend build. Store data in SQLite under `./data`.
The backend is a Go module in `backend/` (package `main`, dependencies in `backend/go.mod` and `backend/go.sum`). The frontend is a Vite project in `frontend/`; `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`.
